{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards of Fortune</strong> is a cooperative multiplayer game blending <strong>rogue-like</strong>, <strong>deckbuilding</strong>, <strong>bullet hell</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong>. Play as a cartomancer and venture into an ancient world filled with magicians, dragons, and forgotten deities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room by room, you\u2019ll face hordes of enemies or take part in unpredictable events. Each victory rewards you with a new spell card, strengthening your magical arsenal with more than <strong>30 unique spells</strong>. Sharpen your tactics\u2014<strong>mana and health management</strong> are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>10 rooms</strong>, a terrifying boss blocks your path. Fight alongside your allies all the way to the <strong>final battle against the divine forces of chaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for cooperation, <i>Cards of Fortune</i> offers <strong>high replayability</strong> thanks to the wide variety of enemies (40+), room configurations, and custom challenges. It\u2019s perfect for fun and strategic gaming sessions with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Platforms</strong>: Windows, Linux<br>\u2726 <strong>Languages</strong>: French, English<br>\u2726 <strong>Cooperative Multiplayer</strong><br>\u2726 <strong>Art direction inspired by Final Fantasy and Undertale</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710930/5c3b2b61c438547f5ec4b99caf3c777e0cae217b.jpg"},{"name":"Cardmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710930/95ce1f2aca26963610aca22562769085ac732461.jpg"},{"name":"Arch Cardmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3710930/661cf33a7f4572b559f59849c29d5cbc227393f9.jpg"},{"name":"Infinity","path":"https://cd